              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Louise Richards"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Loved these...but my advice is...when shredding potato, keep the shreds in ice cold water, this will help remove the starch. Then drain, and using clean paper towels, squish the potatoes, to further dry the shreds...this makes for great pancakes, nice and crispy....",
